    "updated_at": "2020-06-22T01:51:53Z",
    "body": "The reason we don't have this feature is due to the criteria for several package registries. Many of them disallow the distribution of builds that can update themselves so that folks can manage the versions of all their apps with the package registries alone.\r\n\r\nIf we were to implement this, it would have to be behind a build flag, which would only be made available for the pre-built binaries and shell installation method.",
